  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Urban Solid Waste Management Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Gestin Integral de Residuos Slidos Urbanos II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve the comprehensive management of Urban Solid Waste (RSU). The specific objectives of this operation are: (i) to increase the adequate disposal of RSU; (ii) improve the recovery and valuation of MSW with a perspective of social inclusion; (iii) mitigate the negative environmental impacts of open-air dumps.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la gestin integral de Residuos Slidos Urbanos (RSU). Los objetivos especficos de esta operacin son: (i) incrementar la disposicin adecuada de RSU; (ii) mejorar la recuperacin y valorizacin de RSU con perspectiva de inclusin social; (iii) mitigar los impactos negativos ambientales de basurales a cielo abierto.</narrative>
  </description>
